# INVWINCO.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: the drop-down
# lists of the search dialog and the location form.  Search > Find text
# opens the search, whose Category, Status and Works are drop-down lists
# with a blank first row; ESC leaves it.  The location tree's CTRL+E
# edits Box B2, its Type a drop-down list, the type's name field hidden;
# B moves the type to BIN, then BUCKET, OK saves it, the tree's row
# naming Bucket, and CTRL+E shows it selected; its list dropped and moved
# up to BIN, Esc closes it on Bucket again, the hidden name field
# following it; the end by Exit.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINCO.SNP is its snapshot.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER
K ALT-S T
S SEARCH
K ESC
K ALT-L B
K DOWN DOWN CTRL-E
S LOCEDIT
K ALT-T
T B
S LOCB1
T B
S LOCB2
K ENTER
S LOCSAVED
K CTRL-E
S LOCAGAIN
K ALT-T F4 UP ESC
S LOCESC
K ESC ESC
K ALT-F X
